### MediFlow Gateway authentication
### The Gateway delegates credential verification to organization-service.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Login (public)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010

{
  "username": "alex.morgan",
  "password": "StrongPass123"
}

### Refresh (public)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "paste-refresh-token-here"
}
